{"execution_delta":{"candidate_count":5,"plan_ref":"rounds/round_0006/plan.json","schema_version":"algorithm-optimization-execution-delta/v1"},"plan":{"direction":"Add scale-free nearest-unvisited isolation urgency and remove the hard capacity blocker on voluntary early return while retaining the state-only inward-spiral backbone.","hypothesis":"H-008: Unblocking continuous adaptive early return and adding isolation urgency (-w_iso * d_nn/scale) eliminates stranded outlier trips and pushes past both Round 3 (-0.1576 dev4) and Round 5 (ana72=18.00, n200=28.93).","operations":[{"mechanism":"When len(unvisited_nodes) >= 2, compute each candidate's distance to its nearest other feasible unvisited customer: d_nn(j) = min_{k != j} d(j, k) / scale. Subtract w_iso * d_nn(j) (w_iso in [0.15, 0.35], NEGATIVE sign so isolated nodes are harvested while passing nearby instead of stranded as singleton routes).","target":"scale-free isolation urgency term at mid-route (current_node != depot)","type":"add"},{"mechanism":"Remove the rigid `best_dem > 0.55 * rest_capacity` gate that blocked early returns on cross-depot jumps at moderate remaining capacity; instead apply continuous capacity-adaptive early return directly: return depot when (1 - rho[best]) < tau_0 + tau_1 * pressure (tau_0 in 0.22-0.30, tau_1 in 0.35-0.55), optionally guarding against aborting very short hops.","target":"voluntary early-return trigger condition","type":"replace"},{"mechanism":"Keep alpha_eff = alpha_0 - alpha_1 * pressure (state-only), elongation rho, Law-of-Cosines cos(theta_0), smooth calibrated -beta*fill (0.08-0.13), and two-phase rem_routes depot start. Do NOT add discrete exact-fit bin-packing bonuses or stranded-slack penalties.","target":"state-only inward-spiral depot pull, angular coherence cos(theta_0), elongation rho, two-phase depot-start, and strict scale invariance","type":"preserve"}],"ref":"rounds/round_0006/plan.json","semantic_alignment":"unassessed","sha256":"81282e8eb91fb77080e22df